# WARP-8: the sound browser. PRESETS on a drum's EDIT page opens a list of Hortator's sounds by engine, each put on
# the drum and heard; ALGORITHM jumps to the next engine's first sound; HOME closes it, the sound kept
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
tap EDIT
wait 40
expect page Engine
turn PRESET 1
wait 60
said DRUM SOUND
expect par1.d1.model >29
turn PRESET 1
wait 60
said DRUM SOUND
shot browse.png
turn ALGO 1
wait 60
said DRUM SOUND
shot browse_engine.png
turn ALGO -1
wait 60
said DRUM SOUND
# HOME closes the list and stays on the page; again, it is HOME
tap HOME
wait 40
expect page Engine
expect par1.d1.model >29
shot browse_closed.png
turn ALGO 1
wait 40
said DRUM
tap HOME
wait 40
expect page Arrange
